{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128170/extras/b3035f3be69d19b49e823b1483572853.avif?t=1766805670\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128170/extras_big/b3035f3be69d19b49e823b1483572853.webp?t=1766805670 width=1560 height=241 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>On your twentieth birthday</strong>, you receive a very special gift: <strong>a coffee shop</strong>, which you must manage and make successful. Work by serving cups of coffee to earn money and hire maids, whom you can win over with gifts. Increase your charisma with your maids to the maximum in order to have sex with them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into this <strong>hentai visual novel</strong> and experience life as a bartender in a world full of pleasure and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hentai visual novel-style game</strong>, featuring a <strong>bartender minigame</strong> where you throw cups of coffee to your customers as they move forward in different lines, increasing their speed over time. If you\u2019re careless and throw too many cups, or if a customer fails to receive their coffee, you\u2019ll lose points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make sure to earn enough money to pay the rent <strong>before the third day</strong>, or the game will be over.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Content Warning</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains explicit sex, sexual acts, inappropriate language, oral sex, and penetration. All characters depicted are adults, and none of the characters or scenes are real. These are <strong>parodic interpretations</strong> created for humorous, entertainment, and artistic purposes. The game does not seek to glorify or promote the behaviors portrayed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:/